        <stringProp name="TestPlan.comments">Fresh batch per iteration; identities and versions extracted from responses. Required accounts: donor, recycler. Setup requests are named SETUP; compare only the TARGET row for endpoint latency. Matching requires eligible recycler profiles, capacity, active Kafka/worker and collector scopes. Each iteration retains synthetic application records tagged JMeter-load. Evidence upload additionally requires upload_file and upload_mime. Write groups use write_threads/write_ramp_up_seconds/write_loops. Synthetic handoff time uses the server assignment creation timestamp, avoiding client clock skew.</stringProp>
        <stringProp name="ThreadGroup.num_threads">${write_threads}</stringProp>
        <stringProp name="ThreadGroup.ramp_time">${write_ramp_up_seconds}</stringProp>
