      <ThreadGroup guiclass="ThreadGroupGui" testclass="ThreadGroup" testname="27 Failed Collection Load" enabled="false">
        <stringProp name="TestPlan.comments">Fresh batch per iteration; identities and versions extracted from responses. Required accounts: donor, recycler, collector. Setup requests are named SETUP; compare only the TARGET row for endpoint latency. Matching requires eligible recycler profiles, capacity, active Kafka/worker and collector scopes. Each iteration retains synthetic application records tagged JMeter-load. Evidence upload additionally requires upload_file and upload_mime. Write groups use write_threads/write_ramp_up_seconds/write_loops. Synthetic handoff time uses the server assignment creation timestamp, avoiding client clock skew.</stringProp>
