        <stringProp name="TestPlan.comments">Uses donor1/donor2 and write workload settings. Authentication rate limits apply; 429 is a visible failure and stops the thread. Each login/logout iteration creates a fresh session. Refresh logs in once and rotates its extracted refresh token after each successful call.</stringProp>
